'''Divine Charge''' is a type of [[charge]] only available from the item {{il|Garb of the Ephemeral}}. Divine charges do not grant any inherent bonuses.

==Mechanics==
With {{il|Garb of the Ephemeral}}, a Divine charge is gained on [[hit]], gaining a maximum of one charge per second. At maximum Divine charges (10), the {{status link|Divinity|Divinity}} [[buff]] is granted for 10 seconds, and all Divine charges are lost. Divine charges cannot be gained while you have Divinity.

